'''Marcus Green''' (born September 27, 1983) is an American former professional [[American football|football]] player who was a [[defensive tackle]] for the [[Seattle Seahawks]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played [[college football]] for the [[Ohio State Buckeyes football|Ohio State Buckeyes]] and was signed by the [[New York Giants]] as an [[undrafted free agent]] in 2006.<ref>{{cite news | url=https://247sports.com/college/ohio-state/article/bucknuts-mag-excerpts-marcus-green-104284886/ | title=Bucknuts Mag Excerpts: Marcus Green | work=Bucknuts The Magazine | date=January 2006 | accessdate=17 July 2025}}</ref>

